sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant P as Participation Module
  participant DB as PostgreSQL
  participant O as Transactional Outbox
  participant W as Workers
  C->>A: POST join + Idempotency-Key
  A->>P: authorize + command
  P->>DB: begin transaction / capacity lock
  DB-->>P: existing participation + capacity
  P->>DB: insert/update participation
  P->>O: insert domain event in same transaction
  P-->>A: confirmed / requested / waitlisted
  A-->>C: stable logical outcome
  O->>W: publish after commit
  W-->>C: notifications/realtime side effects
